    {
      "bbox": [
        271,
        1581,
        1987,
        1760
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the rapid and convenient movement of people and goods in and about the City of New York is essential to the public health, safety and welfare, and to the economic development of the City, and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2784,
          "min": -1.3132
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0009,
          "min": -0.0009
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 41,
          "mean": -0.001,
          "min": -0.0385
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 10953,
        "area_px": 305016,
        "density": 0.03591,
        "chars": 200,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 18.26
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        271,
        1799,
        1861,
        1977
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the different means of transportation in the City are inextricably related and mutually dependent, and policy decisions bearing on any one transportation mode will have major repercussions on the others, and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2245,
          "min": -1.3081
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 39,
          "mean": -0.0005,
          "min": -0.0098
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 10653,
        "area_px": 281062,
        "density": 0.0379,
        "chars": 216,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 20.28
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        271,
        2018,
        1735,
        2152
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, there presently exists in the City no agency or established medium for coordination of transportation planning, development and operation, and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2132,
          "min": -1.426
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 25,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0027
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7487,
        "area_px": 196155,
        "density": 0.03817,
        "chars": 151,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 20.17
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        271,
        2191,
        1861,
        2369
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, responsibility for transportation matters in New York City is now divided among several public authorities and a number of City agencies, as well as certain private corporations, and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1764,
          "min": -1.0224
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 33,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0004
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 10065,
        "area_px": 282641,
        "density": 0.03561,
        "chars": 191,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 18.98
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        271,
        2408,
        1712,
        2548
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, there is an urgent need for an effective coordinating force in the field of the City's transportation, and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2024,
          "min": -1.2701
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 23,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0007
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 6053,
        "area_px": 200200,
        "density": 0.03023,
        "chars": 115,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 19.0
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        271,
        2587,
        1888,
        2767
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, there is also a need for an indentifiable official and unit in the City Government to promote the improvement of all forms of transportation, within the framework of a balanced transportation system, and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1622,
          "min": -1.1677
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 39,
          "mean": -0.0037,
          "min": -0.1412
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 8076,
        "area_px": 288900,
        "density": 0.02795,
        "chars": 212,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 26.25
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        271,
        2806,
        1841,
        3074
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, many aspects of the City's transportation structure are intimately tied to out-of-City-facilities serving the entire metropolitan region, and the City's transportation problems are of deep concern to the State of New York, and involve both legal and fiscal relationships between State and City, and",
      "logprob_stats": {
